    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1687536873\" /></span><br><br>Galactic Grinder is a fast paced 2.5D side-scrolling skateboarding game, where the player skates through different planets while performing tricks to gain points to attain the best possible score.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1687536873\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/d43ce04e487d7afd4d1b25e8d6cf497a.poster.avif?t=1687536873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/d43ce04e487d7afd4d1b25e8d6cf497a.webm?t=1687536873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/d43ce04e487d7afd4d1b25e8d6cf497a.mp4?t=1687536873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/8517b52f952841ad5808e4f3f8cde35b.poster.avif?t=1687536873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/8517b52f952841ad5808e4f3f8cde35b.webm?t=1687536873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431330/extras/8517b52f952841ad5808e4f3f8cde35b.mp4?t=1687536873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam